</td>
<td style="text-align: center">0x25
</td>
<td><span class="explain" title="Has no programmed catch rate, as it cannot be thrown outside of battle nor selected during battle, even if moved from Key Items to the player&#39;s normal inventory via cheating.">N/A</span>
</td>
