<h4><span id="Pok.C3.A9mon_Pinball:_Ruby_.26_Sapphire"></span><span class="mw-headline" id="Pokémon_Pinball:_Ruby_&amp;_Sapphire">Pokémon Pinball: Ruby &amp; Sapphire</span></h4>
