			<div class="thumb" style="width: 150px; height: 150px;"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Dynamax_Pok%C3%A9_Ball_anime.png" class="mw-file-description" title="A Dynamaxed Poké Ball in Sword and Shield... The Legends Awaken!"><img alt="A Dynamaxed Poké Ball in Sword and Shield... The Legends Awaken!" src="https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/thumb/5/53/Dynamax_Pok%C3%A9_Ball_anime.png/120px-Dynamax_Pok%C3%A9_Ball_anime.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="120" height="68" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/thumb/5/53/Dynamax_Pok%C3%A9_Ball_anime.png/180px-Dynamax_Pok%C3%A9_Ball_anime.png 1.5x, https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/thumb/5/53/Dynamax_Pok%C3%A9_Ball_anime.png/240px-Dynamax_Pok%C3%A9_Ball_anime.png 2x" data-file-width="1280" data-file-height="720" /></a></span></div>
